   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 565,
   "text": "Bird flu, also known as avian influenza, is an infectious disease caused by strains of influenza virus. These are similar to the viruses that cause influenza (flu) in humans.\nSome strains of this virus cause no or mild disease in birds, while others cause severe disease or death. While birds including wild birds and poultry are mainly affected, certain strains can also infect mammals such as wildl",
