   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 342,
   "text": "In people, H5N1 bird flu can cause mild to very serious symptoms. It can sometimes cause death.\nSymptoms usually appear between 2 to 10 days following exposure.\nSee your doctor if you develop flu-like symptoms after recently returning from a country or area with bird flu outbreaks, or after having contact with sick or dead birds or animals.",
